          "move_torrential_light_stream"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While fighting Ying Ming outside the hall, Xiao Mang again flies up and activates Gather Light Gu with Extreme light Gu and River Under the Sun Gu for Torrential Light Stream. The light river breaks through the bronze hall roof.",
